5 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years and July to August in 29. In 2025, February to March on the middle came in at 39% of normal and July to August at 140%. Grid 24433 had its driest year in 1974 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
